                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "01aaa7ba-7d42-33f3-8cd4-62411b402243",
                        "entry_id": "e764225a-339c-38d0-9a4a-22ea003c2732",
                        "glosses": [
                            "край деревни, села"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "51aa7192-4c07-4a9a-b151-bb48ccd2b970",
                                "sense_id": "01aaa7ba-7d42-33f3-8cd4-62411b402243",
                                "text": "До околицы народ шёл медленно и пел хором."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "556c9448-8225-3b1d-ab4b-47d526831115",
                        "entry_id": "e764225a-339c-38d0-9a4a-22ea003c2732",
                        "glosses": [
                            "изгородь вокруг селения или при въезде в него"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea96c931-717a-4772-a888-d1ffe993203e",
                                "sense_id": "556c9448-8225-3b1d-ab4b-47d526831115",
                                "text": "Но едва Владимир выехал за околицу в поле, как поднялся ветер и сделалась такая метель, что он ничего не взвидел."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0deded71-7ca0-36c0-9eaf-9939be68be87",
                        "entry_id": "e764225a-339c-38d0-9a4a-22ea003c2732",
                        "glosses": [
                            "диал. окружающая местность, окру́га"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e6d86f4-93ec-4e4a-bfd7-661b6898819e",
                                "sense_id": "0deded71-7ca0-36c0-9eaf-9939be68be87",
                                "text": "Нам в юности Флоренция сияла, //Нам Филострата нежного на улицах являла //Не фильтрами мы вызвали его, //Не за околицей, где сором поросло."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "47374177-7990-34e9-8d66-671996fd5da7",
                        "entry_id": "e764225a-339c-38d0-9a4a-22ea003c2732",
                        "glosses": [
                            "диал. окольная, не прямая дорога"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ccb41dc2-2201-36a9-94cf-cfff5eef37e8",
                        "entry_id": "e764225a-339c-38d0-9a4a-22ea003c2732",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. диал. то же, что околичность"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "49f3c1db-ea0c-4b38-97e5-580629ce1ed7",
                        "source_entry_id": "e764225a-339c-38d0-9a4a-22ea003c2732",
                        "target_lang_word": "outskirt",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "outskirt",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0b72c5b-711b-37e7-984b-c10bdd85e123",
                                        "entry_id": "904c36f1-47b9-3422-9f38-0659ae1efb1f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A more remote part of a town or city; the periphery, environs; a suburb."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7b7f182-90d1-4a1e-bf9e-f9b7673512e3",
                                                "sense_id": "b0b72c5b-711b-37e7-984b-c10bdd85e123",
                                                "text": "Many people commute into the business district from the outskirts of town."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b4b0090-f64f-42fc-8fc4-337c240c0d79",
                                                "sense_id": "b0b72c5b-711b-37e7-984b-c10bdd85e123",
                                                "text": "I told her of my plan to take John into an urban outskirt area for the purpose of retrieving some vital technical manuals."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c77ea1d-ed36-4df0-a4ec-e0cfcaf68aaf",
                                                "sense_id": "b0b72c5b-711b-37e7-984b-c10bdd85e123",
                                                "text": "The outskirt communities were originally established as labor camps for railroad workers, farm and ranch hands."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11453e17-79b4-4df2-a28d-0e54465a00f6",
                                                "sense_id": "b0b72c5b-711b-37e7-984b-c10bdd85e123",
                                                "text": "Hal Smith, manager of the Ferry Field theatre, Detroit, one of the largest and prettiest outskirt houses in town, played Metro's \"Revelation\" for three days last week"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "outskirt",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dcacb277-ffd5-33ec-8f8d-d930aef23b6e",
                                        "entry_id": "5effd90a-421b-3f9c-9245-01f37db0daeb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To surround as an outskirt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ad508ad2-a021-4ea0-8dfb-ec17947ec399",
                        "source_entry_id": "e764225a-339c-38d0-9a4a-22ea003c2732",
                        "target_lang_word": "outskirts",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "outskirts",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "767c4eb2-3362-305a-87fb-806504ab1869",
                                        "entry_id": "80ed39e5-4812-3387-ae72-31d01277ef32",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The area surrounding a city or town; suburb."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "plural",
                                            "plural-normally"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9580f6a-45ca-4150-a44a-cfaa1b72ea26",
                                                "sense_id": "767c4eb2-3362-305a-87fb-806504ab1869",
                                                "text": "He lived on the outskirts of Paris for a time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "506f7fd0-26f2-47c1-babf-266818ae6635",
                                                "sense_id": "767c4eb2-3362-305a-87fb-806504ab1869",
                                                "text": "The village borders on the Hakka district of Wanluan on the southeastern outskirts of Chaozhou, and its temple is modest in size, with a front and rear chamber and two larger temporary extensions front and side. Yet its members (unaware of similarly named temples in Pingdong as well as Donggang) insist that it is the City God of the county of Pingdong."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d4009e7-e246-4363-8e31-b7ff0907333f",
                                                "sense_id": "767c4eb2-3362-305a-87fb-806504ab1869",
                                                "text": "There are faculty advisers on El’s theater crew who balk at using “they” for one person; classmates at El’s public school on the outskirts of Boston who insist El can’t be “multiple people”; and commenters on El’s social media feeds who dismiss nonbinary gender identities like androgyne (a combination of masculine and feminine), agender (the absence of gender) and gender-fluid (moving between genders) as lacking a basis in biology."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4126746-4101-4b66-9ee5-b1957e0c3253",
                                                "sense_id": "767c4eb2-3362-305a-87fb-806504ab1869",
                                                "text": "More than 100 men, wearing white T-shirts and wielding sticks and clubs, stormed the station in Yuen Long, on Hong Kong’s northwestern outskirts, and assaulted people, including passengers on a subway car."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "outskirts",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
